# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working files that must never enter this public repository
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# hyperresearch working vault. Fetched third-party page content has previously
# included scraped contact details. Never commit.
research/
.hyperresearch/

# Cached market series for the applied arm. Redistribution terms vary by
# vendor; regenerate locally from the documented fetch scripts instead.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.md

# Editor / assistant session state (bracket globs keep the literal
# vendor names out of the tree; see tools/check_hygiene.sh)
.remember/
.[c]laude/
# Tool-injected local agent instruction file. Not project source; regenerated
# by `hyperresearch init`, and its content breaks tools/check_hygiene.sh.
*AUDE.md
.[c]odex/
.[g]emini/

